{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55401","headline":"十玄谈（幷序） 乡还曲（《大正》本、《偈颂》作「达本」） · 常察","name":"十玄谈（幷序） 乡还曲（《大正》本、《偈颂》作「达本」）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"勿於中路事空王，策杖咸须归（《大正》本、《偈颂》作「还须达」）本乡。\n云水隔时君莫住，雪山深处我非忙（《大正》本、《偈颂》作「忘」）。\n寻思去日颜如玉，嗟叹回来（《偈颂》作「时」）鬓似霜。\n撒手到家人不识，更无一物献尊堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常察","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}